{
  "schema": "web-ui-page/1",
  "title": "TalkCompress 利用ガイド",
  "theme": "auto",
  "description": "誰が、どの共有知識・規則を持てば理解できるかを条件に、意味を保てる短い表現を探す実験リポジトリ。文字数・通信バイト数・LLM のトークン数を測ります。",
  "icon": "./icon.png",
  "favicon": "./favicon.png",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "badges",
      "items": [
        "🗜️ 会話の圧縮",
        "📏 文字・バイト・トークンを測る",
        "🐍 Python 3.11.5+"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "📥 取得",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Python 3.11.5+、git、uv が必要です。以下の例はリポジトリ全体を取得して実行します。"
        },
        {
          "type": "output",
          "text": "git clone https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/TalkCompress.git\ncd TalkCompress"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "▶️ 実行",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "📦 準備",
          "text": "依存を入れます。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ uv sync"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "✂️ 1つの層で縮める",
          "text": "層3は、登録済みの略語に置き換えます。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ uv run python DensityFacadeRoute/density_facade_route.py --layer 3 --text \"as soon as possible\"\nASAP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🔗 層を順に適用",
          "text": "C の次に E を適用します。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ uv run python DensityFacadeRoute/density_facade_route.py --pipeline C,E --text \"um thank you for your information\"\nty FYI"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🎯 予算まで縮める",
          "text": "長さが N 以下になるか、縮まなくなるまで繰り返します。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ uv run python DensityFacadeRoute/density_facade_route.py --budget 40 --stats --text \"um thank you for your information please\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "🔗 リンク",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "links",
          "items": [
            {
